      "title": "Institutional Research Data Dictionary",
      "url": "https://ir.ucsd.edu/",
      "summary": "The University of California-San Diego's Institutional Research page provides data and analytics to support informed decision-making. The resource covers undergraduate degrees conferred, student-specific statistics, and survey data such as UCUES and gradSERU. It also offers substantial student success research and analytics, including dashboards that display student enrollment, degree counts, graduation rates, and graduate admissions. Additionally, this page serves as a gateway to decision support resources addressing topics like accreditation and faculty workload, and partners with other university departments to offer more data resources.",
