      "summary": "The University of California-San Diego's Research Administration Glossary provides detailed definitions of terms commonly used in research administration. The glossary includes definitions of different research activities, the concept of allowable costs, rules for using animal subjects in research, and various types of agreements and compliance requirements related to research projects. It aims to guide university faculty and staff in understanding financial, administrative, and procedural aspects involved in research projects.",
